e so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T06:36:46-08:00","id":23718,"title":"","content":"I'm sorry. I can't hear either of you over St. Michael smoking some sissy dragon ass.<br /> <img src=\"http://sandradi.files.wordpress.com/2010/09/st-michael-and-the-dragon-raphael.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Marduk is joining the party too.<br /> <img src=\"http://www.tali-virtualmidrash.org.il/userfiles/BM-tiamat.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Siegfried too.<br /> <img src=\"http://img.myconfinedspace.com/wp-content/uploads/2009/07/Dragon-Slayer-500x375.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","user":"The Revenge of TV Head","date":". 12-05-2013, 09:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T06:40:21-08:00","id":23720,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Telgar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/19994-mortal-antagonists?p=23392#post23392\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And in this scenario, your players are the dragons.</div> </div> </div> </div>Dear fucking god no. If anything in any RPG (except maybe Fireborn), much less Scion, You're not the Dragon.<br /> <br /> You're the fuckin'<i> Dragonslayer.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T07:06:09-08:00","id":23737,"title":"","content":"Well, RPGs aren't predicated upon common sense either.<br /> <br /> St. Michael..god backed human; Marduk...not human. Indeed it took a god for that one; Seigfried also god supported. But it's nice to have confirmation that the few examples that exist made for nice stories. Because any being that can kill a dragon would be <i>epic</i>.<br /> <br /> Fire breathing colossal creatures with armor-plate for skin probably won't pay much attention to vanilla mortals...who would probably be referred to as &quot;fleas.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T08:01:11-08:00","id":23761,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Revenge of TV Head</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/19994-mortal-antagonists?p=23720#post23720\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You're not the Dragon. You're the fuckin'<i> Dragonslayer.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>Sometimes you're both. One of my older players used Unusual Alteration to transform herself into a Chinese Dragon. She stayed that way forever more.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/484-iry","name":"Iry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar484_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"346"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T13:56:13-08:00","id":23959,"title":"","content":"Before you got carried away with your pretty pictures of tiny, wussy dragons, the original quote was <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowflame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/19994-mortal-antagonists?p=23111#post23111\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's like a knight fighting a dragon. It makes a good story when the knight wins. But no one will bet against the dragon.</div> </div> </div> </div>Humanity is the knight fighting the Scion who is a dragon. There are lots of cool stories there, no doubt. But from the dragon's perspective, it's a laughable fight and Scion is written from the dragon's perspective.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T10:57:09-08:00","id":28818,"title":"","content":"Using secret societies as antagonists would be good. Kind of like Hunter conspiracies in WoD, just that their expertise is with the pantheons. A good example is the book, &quot;The Woken Gods&quot;. In it, an ancient society termed Hunters faced with the calamity with the pantheons battling each other in an apocalyptic scenario. To deal with them, they used ancient relics that they collected for millenia, and when they found the portals to the Overworld and Underworld, which they sealed. Bereft of their powers and ability to resurrect, the Hunters took one of the gods and slew her in public. From then the different gods settled down. Hell, the Vatican still has an Inquisition, though under a different name.<br /> I feel that mortals can be actually super ready to deal with Scions and the pantheons. Using Abrahamic antagonists here for an example:<br /> <br /> Hero: A well-prepared priest could still use mundane weapons to take down a Scion in this form. They just have to be smart about it.<br /> <br /> Demigod: When the Scion become high-level legend for Hero or evolve into Demigod mode, then that's when the priest pulls out the Christian relics (saint bones and stuff) The Legend of those relics may help to keep toe-to toe with the demigod in question, if he can.<br /> <br /> God: At this point, that's when the priest prays, and the angels arrive.<br /> <br /> For inspiration, try to translate Conspiracies from Hunter: The Vigil into Scion, especially from the new book, Mortal Remains. You'd be surprised on what a well-prepared mortal can do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}